stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Selecting: start-session
  Selecting --> NoResult: refusal, timeout or cancellation
  Selecting --> Managed: command selected and started
  Managed --> Cleaning: first end-session publication
  Managed --> Cleaning: natural exit or cancellation
  Cleaning --> Returned: result published, cleanup succeeds, no cancellation
  Cleaning --> NoResult: absent result, cancellation or cleanup failure
  Returned --> [*]: successful status and opaque stdout
  NoResult --> [*]: unsuccessful status, no successful result
  note right of Returned
    Caller interprets the argument.
    Managed output is separate from result stdout.
  end note
